5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to ensure the operational side is feasible. I will look into the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to see where the time is actually being lost. I'll check the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city and the journey audits on where minutes go.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A prudent approach. I shall examine the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates to see where the money actually sits.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is wise to remember the past. I will look into the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme and the two pilots from eight years ago.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am interested in the hidden hurdles. I will review the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells and the joint operators' committee minutes.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
